    "notes": "The Haas-Lilienthal House exterior at 2007 Franklin Street in San Francisco as photographed in May 2015. Includes the 1886 main residence, pointed southeast turret, stair and covered entry, multiple gables, and the attached 1929 rear guest and garage wing. Interiors and neighboring buildings are outside the reconstruction. The roof and porch are interpreted from the native plan, two exact 2015 originals and the independently verified HABS east-front view."
